WEBVTT

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:15.200
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:35.110
Senpai!

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:41.230
Senpa...

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.560
I'm so glad you're alive...

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:50.040
<b>Episode 9: Messenger of Awakening</b>

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:50.460
I had the longest, most terrible dream...

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:53.780
You died, and I snapped,

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.660
and became a psychic soldier 
who was protecting the Earth,

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.430
fighting aliens.

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:03.270
But after a while, I started to think that

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:06.890
the Earthlings were more 
dangerous than the aliens.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:10.700
I betrayed the Earth and joined the aliens.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:14.810
It sounds kinda stupid,
 with psychic soldiers and stuff.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:20.840
But I was just frantic... and scared.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.140
The nightmare lasted so long...

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:25.870
Brother!

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:28.000
Benika!

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:29.660
Yosuke?

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:34.070
Yosuke fought with me.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:37.840
In the dream, I counted on him for a lot.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.630
Don't tell him that.

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:43.410
What? What are you talking about?

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:44.960
Nothing.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:45.640
Yeah?

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:49.430
I'm glad you're safe, though, Brother.

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:50.640
When do you leave the hospital?

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.990
Her photon armor was destroyed,

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:01.990
and she was exposed to the 
field of the sealing device.

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:06.950
Benika-san's probably having 
a wonderful dream right now.

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:10.430
Some people wake up sooner than others,

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.380
but when she does,

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:15.350
she'll be peaceful, like another person.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:18.670
Yes, I know.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:20.890
I'll fight, too.

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:23.670
I'll go once Benika wakes up.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.090
Once I've at least said something to her.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.830
She looks so happy.

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:35.600
I'm sure there's no place 
for me in her dream.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:38.080
Brother...

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:40.980
Make Benika happy, please.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:45.950
<i>And when he does, Soya-kun,</i>

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.370
I want you to defeat him.

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:54.330
Fine. Whatever.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:58.610
If I'm sealed, I can live 
happily in my dreams.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:02.720
And if the dragon kills me, 
I can see everyone who died.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.680
So I'm not going to fight anymore.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.060
What do you think, Sensei?

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:15.610
Soya-kun said the People of Paradise 
told him the dragon was alive.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.150
That's right.

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.870
We need to look into this more first.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:27.620
Soya-kun's only gotten 
more depressed since then.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:29.670
Is he okay?

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.960
He's fine, you say?

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:35.790
That's right.

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.000
If you say so...

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:44.130
I'm sorry. He doesn't seem to want to get up.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:44.930
No...

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.260
That's right.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:52.910
There are even fewer students now.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.430
Your family's not moving?

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:58.860
My parents both work for the school,

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:03.570
and they say they're not leaving while 
there's even a single student left.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:07.030
They're volunteering to help 
clean up the rubble, too.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.830
They're great people, huh?

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:12.200
Yes.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:18.650
Do you have any idea where Director 
Takashi Ryuzoji may have gone?

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.340
I told you, no.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.170
How many times do I have to say it?

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:25.260
Here you are.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.840
<b>Special Black Japanese Beef</b>

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:28.840
This is a gift. It's special
 black Japanese beef.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.550
We heard you liked it.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:34.060
Don't feed something so fatty to an old man.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.650
Takashi might be gone, but you 
still have Torai-kun, right?

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.940
Yes, but we really don't have enough 
information to know what's going on.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.930
No respect for his father...

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.290
Good morning, Benika.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:58.310
Good morning, Yosuke.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:01.090
I'll be going, then.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.720
How was it, you ask?

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.470
I got a clear vision of what the 
end of the world would look like.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.880
Now I feel like I can seal the world.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:23.330
I've given you the last sealing 
device I brought to Earth.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:26.040
Good luck.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.280
Kuroi-kun, are you up?

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:36.000
I know it's hard, now that you've remembered.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:39.690
It feels like what kept 
you going is gone, right?

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:43.920
I think what you need now is rest.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:48.860
No matter how you feel, I'm your friend.

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:52.180
It doesn't matter if you're 
an alien or Earthling.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:53.710
I...

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.980
I'm on the side of the 
people I want to befriend.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:17.540
Takatori lost, and you still 
want to fight, Hitsujitani-kun?

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:22.940
To you, I'm just Benika's hanger-on, 
with no will of my own, right?

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.840
I thought so. But I guess I was wrong.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.580
You weren't.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.220
Benika was my whole world.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.180
So I'm done with this place.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:37.080
Go to sleep beside my Benika, Earth.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:41.350
Psychokinetic Photon Armor... Plus!

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:59.070
He kept using his photon armor until 
he absorbed the whole Nebula Weapon?

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.290
Can you do that?

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.640
Unbelievable!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.970
The warrior of light was blasted backwards 
into the city with a single strike.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:22.060
The huge object is getting closer!

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:22.810
The light—

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:33.240
<b>Huge Unknown Object Warning Issued
Massive Object Appears Off Coast of Soramisaka City</b>

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:28.900
<i>I think it's time for me to go home.</i>

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.070
<i>This broadcast is over, everyone.</i>

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.240
<i>Goodbye.</i>

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.940
<i>This is the studio!</i>

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:37.190
<i>Takahashi-san, come in! What happened?</i>

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:40.410
The sealing field reached the Earth?

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.290
Kuroi-kun?

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.730
Wow...

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:50.430
Psychic powers are affected by 
the beliefs of their wielder.

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:53.330
He's lost something that 
weighed the same as the world,

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:55.460
and now he can synchronize with the world.

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:58.350
It will be easy for him to seal the world.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.640
Is that it, Generalissimo?

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:03.140
Earthlings really are terrifying.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:07.100
They're a race that truly must be sealed.

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:13.850
Sorry we're late!

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:18.120
It took time to activate the 
photon armor without our vials!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.010
We can't just let this happen!

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:23.330
We'll fight too, Torai-san!

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:25.370
Inaba! Kumashiro!

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:28.330
Wait! He's different than 
any foe we've faced before!

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.300
You said you wouldn't fight anymore.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:45.680
As you asked, Generalissimo, 
I fought and won.

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:49.650
Now I'll start the sealing.

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:33.520
The world can't be much bigger than this.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.730
Goodnight.

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:03.840
Ginko! Sensei! Nozo-san!

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:11.270
Sound has disappeared from the world.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:15.740
We, the Sealing Faction, have won.

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:39.090
It's over.

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:45.850
Now if I can just go back to the 
spaceship and get sealed myself,

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:47.610
it will all...

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:52.750
I can't believe it covered 
the entire Earth.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:57.130
The Pacifists never showed up.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:12:01.160
"It's unfortunate that this ended with
 them being sealed with the Earth..."

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.280
Is that it?

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.600
There's no way to break the seal.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.450
It's a terrifying weapon.

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:12.450
They were... sealed.

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:15.280
Even Ginko and Sensei.

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:18.490
But why am I the only one who wasn't?

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:21.600
Hey.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.140
So it was you.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:29.660
Yeah. You don't look surprised.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:32.850
Well, what else could it be?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:39.350
So of course, you showed up because
you're able to do something about this.

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:41.070
Do you want me to do something?

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.020
Thank you.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:15.720
Please.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:18.610
Save everyone.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.900
I want you to defeat the dragon.

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:25.280
Yeah. I will.

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:27.550
It's a deal.

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:30.030
I knew that was the kind of kid you were.

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.870
You have a hero's destiny.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:37.660
The real hero's lying on the floor there.

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:41.920
Okay, let's get started.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:42.550
Sure.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:49.590
What? I'm huge!

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.220
I expanded your mind, that's all.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:55.720
The real you is in your apartment.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:14:02.440
Now your voice can reach into the 
dreams of everyone who was sealed.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.710
Speak to them.

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:10.570
People of Earth, can you hear me?

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:13.740
I'm an alien.

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:17.370
I lost my home, and now I live here on Earth.

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:21.000
Right now, you're dreaming.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.980
There are aliens who think you're dangerous.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:29.660
And they've sealed your minds 
within pleasant dreams.

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.770
I guess it's like...

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.960
They're trying to seal your 
desire to move forward,

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:38.640
so that you won't evolve anymore.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:44.360
I'm sure you all feel really happy now.

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:49.150
I'm sure you feel happy and saved.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:52.700
You want to stay in those dreams forever.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:59.290
But if anybody wants to awaken now that 
you know it's a dream, raise your hand.

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:01.970
You don't have to.

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:07.090
If I was dreaming of my lost home, 
I wouldn't want to wake up, either.

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:14.430
So only raise your hand if you 
really want to return to reality.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.030
I'm pulling them up.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.660
My... My planet...

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.150
We were wrong!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:50.270
But people of this planet,

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:52.560
please don't make the mistake we did!

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:03.020
Kuroi-kun...

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:06.610
I heard your voice, Soya-kun.

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:10.490
Welcome back, everyone.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.270
And...

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.310
I'm sorry.

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:15.990
Help me, Sensei!

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.000
I had the most wonderful dream.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.290
What was that?

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:25.420
I saw Granny!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.140
Mom told me to go...

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:29.300
Beth saw me off!

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.130
Sound has returned to the world!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:36.640
Humanity's minds are returning to them!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:52.820
How? I sealed you!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.520
H-He's strong!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:08.790
Miu-chan, are you okay?

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:09.920
Haru-chan!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.150
Don't stay together! Split up!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.590
Fine.

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:18.050
I'll just defeat you again. 
And seal you again.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.640
As many times as it takes!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:32.480
That's...

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.240
The Nebula Soldier!

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:35.450
Hey.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:40.530
Damn! He revived, too?

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.990
Your tail seems happy...

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:45.500
Shut up.

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:47.790
How's the battle going?

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:48.630
Where's Yosuke?

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.130
Even Benika-san?

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.090
What's going on?

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:01.220
He's standing exposed in 
the sealing device's field!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.920
You three Earthlings get back!

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:06.350
I'll defeat the big one!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:09.190
Wh-What are you saying?

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.190
That's crazy!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:13.460
Yeah! We need to work together...

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:16.870
Tell me, Nebula Soldier.

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:19.450
Why did you come? Why do you fight?

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:22.680
Wasn't your fight over?

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:26.210
Yeah. This isn't my planet.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.910
And I don't need to seek revenge from him.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.170
But...

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:35.510
The people who tried to protect me,

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.090
and who tried to save me, are here.

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:44.920
I... I'm on the side of the 
people I want to befriend.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:45.990
That's all!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.820
I'm grateful to you, too.

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:53.490
I know this is really late, 
but thanks for the shoes.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:54.870
Shoes?

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:59.570
And don't call me "Nebula Soldier!"

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:02.120
My name is Soya.

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:04.080
Soya Kuroi!

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:06.350
Hey, Sealing Faction!

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:10.170
I know it's late, but I'm accepting 
your declaration of war!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:14.110
Along with the warrior of Nebula's 
Pacifist Faction, Sensei...

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.720
...Ginko Kuroi...

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.600
...and Soya Kuroi...

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:26.180
...will give you all the 
war you could ever want!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.470
Spaceship, transform to battle mode!

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.200
Let's go!

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:46.160
Nyah!

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:49.660
What the hell do you mean, nyah?

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:54.960
Stay out of Earth's problems, aliens!

00:19:55.600 --> 00:20:00.380
Earthlings need to be sealed!

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.980
Me... and Benika, too...

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:06.430
The sorrow we felt when we lost 
my brother, lost the world...

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:10.640
We can only be free from it in our dreams!

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:20.170
You lost your brother, too?

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:21.380
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.000
But...

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:29.650
No matter how much it hurts, 
the past is the past.

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:32.810
Even if in reality, my home is gone,

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.470
reality is still my home!

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:41.130
I'm right here, right now!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.310
And all I have is now!

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:48.550
I realized that the people 
who share this moment with me

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:51.180
have always been there to help me!

00:20:58.280 --> 00:21:00.820
Let's go, Ginko, Sensei!

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:12.310
Tera Cat Hammer!

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.090
My photon armor...

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:29.190
It's useless... I'm doomed.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.700
It doesn't matter. I'm sure that anyway...

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.150
Benika...

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:41.540
Yosuke, I'm sorry for everything.

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:48.740
What are you apologizing for, Benika?

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:50.800
A lot of things.

00:21:58.760 --> 00:22:01.750
Are you watching, boss 
of the Sealing Faction!

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:03.210
Come on down!

00:22:03.740 --> 00:22:05.420
We'll settle this!

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:09.930
<b><i>To Be Continued</i></b>

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:45.090
<b><i>Next
Karellen and Rashaverak</i></b>

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:45.090
"Karellen and Rashaverak."
